    "Lend out a book (collects borrower name) and Mark returned",
    "Filter to show All books or Lent out only",
    "Live Lent out count",
    "Persist books across page refresh via localStorage",
    "Validate required Title and Author input",
    "Recover from malformed saved data without crashing",
